{1}{The telegram sent by Elder Joachim...I don't know what to make of it.  It seems that he thinks it very important to find out why these men are trying to kill you...much more important than being here to protect you...}{The telegram sent by Elder Joachim...I don't know what to make of it.  It seems that he thinks it very important to find out why these men are trying to kill you...much more important than being here to protect you...}{}{1}{}{}
{2}{I thought that was your job, Virgil...}{}{5}{}{6}{}
