{4}{You protect me, Virgil!}{}{-4}{}{6}{}
{6}{It is, blast it!  I'm sorry...I don't mean to get so angry...I just don't have any idea what's going on here.  All I know is that Joachim showed me a better way, a new faith, and now I'm involved in something even I don't believe.  [He looks at you, questioningly.]  What do YOU think?}{It is, blast it!  I'm sorry...I don't mean to get so angry...I just don't have any idea what's going on here.  All I know is that Joachim showed me a better way, a new faith, and now I'm involved in something even I don't believe.  [He looks at you, questioningly.]  What do YOU think?}{}{2}{}{}
