{13}{[Virgil studies for you for a moment, then nods his head.]  Yes...there is a particular wisdom in your words.  [He laughs.]  And crying about this prophecy gibberish isn't going to keep a knife out of your ribs.  I'll shut up for a while, and we'll concentrate on that ring.  If we find the owner, maybe we'll find out why those bloody assassins want it so badly...}{[Virgil studies for you for a moment, then nods his head.]  Yes...there is a particular wisdom in your words.  [He laughs.]  And crying about this prophecy gibberish isn't going to keep a knife out of your ribs.  I'll shut up for a while, and we'll concentrate on that ring.  If we find the owner, maybe we'll find out why those bloody assassins want it so badly...}{}{3}{}{}
{14}{That sounds fine, Virgil...}{}{5}{}{16}{}
{16}{Alright.  [He seems relieved.]  Listen, Tarant is a big city, and a man needs to watch what he does and who he talks to.  Believe me, I know a lot about surviving in places like this.  This, and worse.  Just keep one eye always open, and one hand always on your weapon.  You can't trust strangers, and sometimes not even your friends.  I used to, uh...}{Alright.  [He seems relieved.]  Listen, Tarant is a big city, and a man needs to watch what he does and who he talks to.  Believe me, I know a lot about surviving in places like this.  This, and worse.  Just keep one eye always open, and one hand always on your weapon.  You can't trust strangers, and sometimes not even your friends.  I used to, uh...}{}{4}{}{}
{17}{Sounds like you know a lot about surviving in the streets...}{}{5}{}{19}{}
{19}{I used to...well...that was another time. [He looks down.]  I...uh...know my way around.  Just be on your guard, and I'll be watching out for you as well...}{I used to...well...that was another time. [He looks down.]  I...uh...know my way around.  Just be on your guard, and I'll be watching out for you as well...}{}{5}{}{}
