{32}{[Virgil throws up his hands.]  Oh that's just bloody wonderful!   Then maybe I'll just go home and leave you to get your skull smashed by...[He takes a deep breath, steadying himself.]  Listen, I don't understand this anymore than you do.  Not long ago I'd have had a good belly-laugh over the whole thing.  [He looks at you, questioningly.]  What do YOU think?}{[Virgil throws up his hands.]  Oh that's just bloody wonderful!   Then maybe I'll just go home and leave you to get your skull smashed by...[He takes a deep breath, steadying himself.]  Listen, I don't understand this anymore than you do.  Not long ago I'd have had a good belly-laugh over the whole thing.  [He looks at you, questioningly.]  What do YOU think?}{}{10}{}{}
